# Neither AutoApply application reads .env files or requires environment variables.
# This reference is informational; copying it to .env does not configure the app.
#
# Chrome extension:
#   Set provider, model, endpoint, and API key in Console -> Settings.
#   Save Settings, then Test Connection. No API key is included here.
#
# Standalone Python job tracker:
#   No API key or environment variables are required.
#   Run with --server.address 127.0.0.1 --browser.gatherUsageStats false
#   when starting from the repository root.
